// The only writer of CyrusProject / CyrusRevision / CyrusProjectAsset / CyrusIdentifier.
// Rules: revisions are append-only (no function here edits or deletes their content); a revision's status moves
// once, pending -> passed | failed; a project always records its last passing revision; a revert is a NEW revision
// that copies an older one's content. Appends lock the project row (FOR UPDATE), so seq has no gaps and two writers
// cannot both build on the same head.
